  broadcasting applied.

  >>> tf.where(True, [1, 2, 3, 4], 100).numpy()
  array([1, 2, 3, 4], dtype=int32)
  >>> tf.where(False, [1, 2, 3, 4], 100).numpy()
  array([100, 100, 100, 100], dtype=int32)

